00:15:50,737 --> 00:15:55,426
With the dimensions in Table 4-1, work out by hand where P,

197
00:15:55,446 --> 00:16:01,092
M and E are at a shaft angle of 90 degrees, and the transmission angle,

198
00:16:01,112 --> 00:16:03,247
then check them in the lab.

199
00:16:03,647 --> 00:16:05,557
Two, adjustment. In the lab,

200
00:16:05,577 --> 00:16:10,382
