214
00:17:11,027 --> 00:17:12,607
Three things to remember.

215
00:17:13,007 --> 00:17:18,608
One: the take-up lends and takes back thread by shaft angle, giving,

216
00:17:18,628 --> 00:17:22,990
taking up and drawing each stitch; giving is hardest,

217
00:17:23,010 --> 00:17:25,387
and supply must cover demand.

218
00:17:25,787 --> 00:17:31,094
Two: industrial machines use the four-bar, smooth and durable,

219
00:17:31,114 --> 00:17:35,647
at the cost of extra thread held by the check spring.

220
00:17:36,047 --> 00:17:42,752
Three: the three criteria, before eye-in, after eye-in, and catch to cast-off;

221
00:17:42,772 --> 00:17:48,787
move the guide for thick cloth, and re-check after re-timing the hook.

